The first recorded run over the whole corpus, both targets, with the
LibreOffice open check. Raw outputs stay under the corpus directory as
runs/2026-09-16-39defb7; only the record pair comes into the repository.
Workbooks appear as ids only: no original name, note, producer_version or
app, and no corpus path (specs/0005-corpus.md, planning ruling 5 of
2026-09-16).

TERMS, as planning authorised on 2026-09-16 (ruling 6):
  - both target builds were finished by the gate before this run started,
    so no cargo ran during it;
  - foreground, serialized, host then i686, nothing else running;
  - CARGO_BUILD_JOBS=4, this box having stopped two T0 P6d gate runs for
    low memory;
  - no mid-run tuning: a conversion that timed out or was killed would be
    recorded as error and listed apart, never rerun with a larger value.
  Neither run was stopped by the environment, so no rerun note applies.

